This repository is publicly visible so that it can serve as a portfolio.
NO open-source license is granted.

You may:
- view the source code on GitHub,
- play the games in a web browser, including via the published website (GitHub Pages).

Without prior written permission from the author, you may not:
- copy the code, graphics, sounds or other content, in whole or in part,
- modify it or create derivative works,
- redistribute, publish, sublicense or sell it,
- use it in other projects, commercial or non-commercial.

GitHub's Terms of Service (such as forking within GitHub) remain unaffected.
